# Local JDK installations and zip packages
jdk11/
jdk17/
*.zip

# Dependency trees and build output — regenerated locally, never to be tracked.
# `functions/node_modules/` is the npm install tree for the Cloud Functions package and
# `functions/lib/` is the compiled output of `npm run build` (`main: lib/index.js`).
# Ignoring them keeps `git status` to the real source changes instead of thousands of
# dependency files. No file is deleted by these rules.
node_modules/
functions/lib/

# R14-P2-01: build artefacts, device captures and secrets never belong in the repository.
# The round removed a committed device database, two JVM crash logs and two JFR replays; these rules
# stop the next one. `scripts/check_repo_hygiene.mjs` fails the build if a forbidden file is tracked.
*.apk
*.aab
*.hprof
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
*.jks
*.keystore
my-upload-key.jks
_device_test/*.sqlite
# R15-P2-06: the supply-chain script's output is a build artefact, not a source file.
dependency-report.json
lint-summary.txt
